    },
    {
      "id": "b0150",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f378c9a507d542e7",
      "translationZh": "Google Notebook 即将上线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0151",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "786b83f8c83ec50d",
      "translationZh": "Vertex AI model garden 即将上线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0152",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4be0f860ee356091",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0153",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76573dd0276ee09a",
      "translationZh": "若没有众多社区成员的贡献，就不可能发布这样的模型，并在生态系统中提供支持和评估。其中，Clémentine 和 Nathan 负责 LLM 评估；Nicolas 负责 Text Generation Inference 支持；Arthur、Sanchit、Joao 和 Lysandre 负责将 Gemma 2 集成到 transformers 中；Nathan 和 Victor 负责让 Gemma 2 在 Hugging Chat 中可用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9bad0c4af1d1ae0",
      "translationZh": "同时，感谢 Google 团队发布 Gemma 2，并将其提供给开源 AI 社区！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
